---
/**
 * Terms of Service Page
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/global/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/global/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'May 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms of service for The Pizza Dough Formula. Read the rules and disclaimers that apply when you use this site."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-grow">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16">
      <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl font-bold text-text mb-2">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted mb-8">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="prose prose-lg text-text-muted space-y-6">
        <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed">
          By using The Pizza Dough Formula, you agree to these terms. Please read them carefully.
          If you do not agree, please do not use the site.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-semibold text-text mt-8 mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service govern your access to and use of thepizzadoughformula.com,
          including the calculator, content pages, and any related tools or features (the "Site").
          Your continued use of the Site after any update to these terms means you accept the changes.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-semibold text-text mt-8 mb-4">2. Use of the Site</h2>
        <p>
          You may use the Site for personal, non-commercial purposes such as planning home baking,
          learning about pizza, and sharing recipes with friends and family. You agree not to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
          <li>Scrape, copy, or republish substantial portions of our content without written permission</li>
          <li>Reverse engineer, modify, or interfere with the calculator or other tools</li>
          <li>Use the Site in any way that violates applicable laws or regulations</li>
          <li>Attempt to disrupt, attack, or compromise the security of the Site</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-semibold text-text mt-8 mb-4">3. Calculator Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          The dough calculator and related tools provide estimates based on baker's percentage
          formulas. Results depend on factors we cannot measure for you, including flour brand,
          ambient humidity, oven calibration, yeast freshness, and your own technique. Treat the
          numbers as a starting point and adjust based on what your dough is actually doing.
        </p>
        <p>
          You are responsible for safe food handling, including proofing temperatures, ingredient
          freshness, and any allergen considerations for the people you cook for. We accept no
          liability for outcomes that depend on factors outside our calculator.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-semibold text-text mt-8 mb-4">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          All content on the Site, including text, graphics, calculator code, logos, and design,
          is owned by The Pizza Dough Formula or its licensors and is protected by copyright and
          other intellectual property laws. You may save, print, or share recipes for personal use.
          Republishing content on another website, in print, or in any commercial product requires
          written permission.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-semibold text-text mt-8 mb-4">5. Affiliate Links</h2>
        <p>
          The Site contains affiliate links to products on Amazon and other retailers. If you click
          one of these links and make a purchase, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
          See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure" class="text-primary hover:underline">Affiliate Disclosure</a>
          for full details.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-semibold text-text mt-8 mb-4">6. Third-Party Services and Links</h2>
        <p>
          The Site uses third-party services (PostHog, n8n, Cloudflare, Amazon)
          and links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the content, privacy practices,
          or terms of any third-party service or site. Review their policies before using them.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-semibold text-text mt-8 mb-4">7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          The Site is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, express
          or implied. We do not warrant that the Site will be uninterrupted, error-free, secure,
          or free from harmful components. Recipes, calculations, and recommendations are provided
          for informational purposes only.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-semibold text-text mt-8 mb-4">8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, The Pizza Dough Formula and its operator shall
          not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages
          arising from your use of, or inability to use, the Site. Our total liability for any
          claim related to the Site is limited to one hundred United States dollars (USD $100).
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-semibold text-text mt-8 mb-4">9. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top of this
          page reflects the most recent revision. Material changes will be highlighted on the Site
          when reasonable.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-semibold text-text mt-8 mb-4">10. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Ohio, United States, without regard
          to conflict-of-law principles. Any dispute arising from your use of the Site shall be
          resolved in the state or federal courts located in Ohio.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-semibold text-text mt-8 mb-4">11. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms? Reach out at:
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          <a href="mailto:admin@thedoughformula.com" class="text-primary hover:underline font-medium">
            admin@thedoughformula.com
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
